This Terraform configuration sets up a VPC with three subnets: one public subnet and two private subnets. It also creates an EC2 instance in the public subnet for web servers, an EC2 instance in the first private subnet for application servers, and an RDS instance in the second private subnet for the database. The configuration includes basic settings and tags for each resource.

