This Terraform program creates a DynamoDB table with replicas in the `us-west-1` and `us-west-2` regions. The main DynamoDB table is created in `us-west-1`, and a global table is set up to manage the replicas across the specified regions.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-1"
}

resource "aws_dynamodb_table" "dynamodb_table" {
  name           = "my-global-table"
  billing_mode   = "PAY_PER_REQUEST"
  hash_key       = "myAttribute"
